Oo.

252
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:47,679
Kailangan mo maglagda dahil ipapadala ito sa rehistradong sulat.

253
00:11:47,702 --> 00:11:53,702
Ano ang mangyayari kung wala ako sa bahay?

254
00:11:53,725 --> 00:11:56,159
Mag-iiwan ng notipikasyon ang tao sa koreo.

255
00:11:56,182 --> 00:11:58,272
Notipikasyon?

256
00:11:58,295 --> 00:11:59,738
Oo.

257
00:11:59,762 --> 00:12:03,795
Tignan mo ang papel at kontakin ang opisina ng koreo.

258
00:12:03,818 --> 00:12:05,985
Naintindihan ko po.

259
00:12:06,008 --> 00:12:09,778
Paano ko kukunin ang pera bago dumating ang card?

260
00:12:09,801 --> 00:12:12,837
Hindi ko ba pwedeng kunin ang pera?

261
00:12:12,860 --> 00:12:17,194
Kung may passbook at selyo ka, puwede kang mag-withdraw sa counter.

262
00:12:17,217 --> 00:12:19,295
Ganoon po ba.

263
00:12:19,318 --> 00:12:24,187
Pero ang counter ay sarado na pagdating ng alas-tres, kaya mag-ingat ka.

264
00:12:24,211 --> 00:12:25,744
Oo.

265
00:12:25,767 --> 00:12:27,460
Naintindihan ko po.

266
00:12:27,484 --> 00:12:31,450
Kapag dumating na ang card mo, sulatan mo ang likod ng pangalan mo.

267
00:12:31,473 --> 00:12:33,010
Oo.

268
00:12:33,034 --> 00:12:36,909
Huwag ibigay ang PIN number mo sa kahit sino.

269
00:12:36,933 --> 00:12:38,416
Oo.

270
00:12:38,439 --> 00:12:40,287
Siyempre.

271
00:12:40,310 --> 00:12:44,379
Kung nawala, tumawag ka agad sa bangko.

272
00:12:44,403 --> 00:12:46,170
Naintindihan ko po.

273
00:12:46,193 --> 00:12:49,593
Saan makikita ang numero ng telepono?

274
00:12:49,616 --> 00:12:52,227
Nakasulat sa likod ng passbook.

275
00:12:52,250 --> 00:12:53,850
Oo.

276
00:12:53,873 --> 00:12:55,923
Salamat po.

277
00:12:55,947 --> 00:12:57,447
Tagpo 8: Pag-withdraw ng Pera sa Bangko

278
00:12:57,447 --> 00:12:59,618
Kamusta po.

279
00:12:59,642 --> 00:13:03,975
Excuse me, gusto kong mag-withdraw ng pera.

280
00:13:03,998 --> 00:13:06,010
Narito po.

281
00:13:06,033 --> 00:13:08,966
May dala ka bang ATM card?

282
00:13:08,989 --> 00:13:13,357
Ay, nakalimutan ko ang card sa bahay.

283
00:13:13,380 --> 00:13:17,669
Ganoon ba? May passbook ka ba?

284
00:13:17,693 --> 00:13:22,260
Oo, may passbook at selyo ako.

285
00:13:22,283 --> 00:13:27,156
Kung ganoon, puwede kang magproseso sa counter na ito.

286
00:13:27,179 --> 00:13:29,412
Salamat sa Diyos.

287
00:13:29,435 --> 00:13:33,092
Paki-fill out ang form na ito.

288
00:13:33,115 --> 00:13:36,649
Saan ko po ito isusulat?

289
00:13:36,672 --> 00:13:40,131
Dito at dito lang paki-sulat.

290
00:13:40,154 --> 00:13:42,443
Ito ba ang pangalan?

291
00:13:42,467 --> 00:13:46,877
Oo, tapos sa ibaba, isulat mo ang halaga.

292
00:13:46,901 --> 00:13:50,960
Gusto kong mag-withdraw ng sandaang libong yen ngayon.

293
00:13:50,984 --> 00:13:53,076
Naintindihan ko po.

294
00:13:53,099 --> 00:13:58,306
Dito lang isulat ang 'sandaang libong yen'.

295
00:13:58,329 --> 00:14:01,426
Opo, nasulat ko na.

296
00:14:01,449 --> 00:14:03,249
Salamat po.

297
00:14:03,272 --> 00:14:07,290
Sunod, dito mo tatakan ng selyo.

298
00:14:07,313 --> 00:14:10,985
Oo, ito ba ay tama na?

299
00:14:11,008 --> 00:14:14,575
Oo, ayos lang po.

300
00:14:14,598 --> 00:14:17,798
Makukuha ko ba agad ang pera?

301
00:14:17,821 --> 00:14:22,102
Magche-check lang muna kami, pakihintay po.

302
00:14:22,125 --> 00:14:23,725
Oo.

303
00:14:23,748 --> 00:14:27,348
Maupo ka na lang muna doon sa upuan.

304
00:14:27,371 --> 00:14:30,538
May numero po ba ako?

305
00:14:30,561 --> 00:14:34,649
Oo, tatawagin ka namin gamit ang numerong ito.

306
00:14:34,672 --> 00:14:36,742
Naiintindihan ko na.

307
00:14:36,765 --> 00:14:39,174
Pasensya na po sa paghihintay.

308
00:14:39,198 --> 00:14:41,769
Mga customer na numero labinlima.

309
00:14:41,792 --> 00:14:43,489
Oo.

310
00:14:43,512 --> 00:14:48,246
Ito ang sandaang libong yen at ang iyong passbook.

311
00:14:48,269 --> 00:14:50,440
Paki-check po.

312
00:14:50,463 --> 00:14:53,532
Oo, salamat po.

313
00:14:53,556 --> 00:14:55,056
Tagpo 9: Proseso ng Pagpapadala ng Pera sa Ibang Bansa

314
00:14:55,056 --> 00:14:57,122
Kamusta po.

315
00:14:57,145 --> 00:14:59,979
Ano po ang maipaglilingkod namin ngayon?

316
00:15:00,002 --> 00:15:03,500
Gusto kong magpadala ng pera sa ibang bansa.

317
00:15:03,523 --> 00:15:05,256
Narito po.

318
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:07,679
Pagpapadala ng pera sa ibang bansa, di ba?

319
00:15:07,702 --> 00:15:09,269
Oo.

320
00:15:09,292 --> 00:15:12,826
Ipapadala ko sa pamilya ko sa aking bansa.

321
00:15:12,849 --> 00:15:15,748
Saang bansa mo ipapadala?

322
00:15:15,771 --> 00:15:18,572
Ipapadala ko sa Vietnam.

323
00:15:18,596 --> 00:15:20,396
Naintindihan ko po.

324
00:15:20,419 --> 00:15:23,752
May dala ka ba ng impormasyon ng padadalhan?

325
00:15:23,776 --> 00:15:25,247
Oo.

326
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:29,874
Mayroon akong tala ng pangalan ng bangko at numero ng account.

327
00:15:29,898 --> 00:15:31,898
Salamat po.

328
00:15:31,921 --> 00:15:35,329
Kailan darating ang pera?

329
00:15:35,352 --> 00:15:39,191
Mga tatlo hanggang pitong araw bago dumating.

330
00:15:39,214 --> 00:15:41,014
Ganoon po ba.

331
00:15:41,037 --> 00:15:44,333
Iba-iba depende sa bansa at bangko.

332
00:15:44,357 --> 00:15:46,890
Magkano ang bayad?

333
00:15:46,913 --> 00:15:51,513
Ang bayad sa counter para sa pagpapadala ay apat na libong yen.

334
00:15:51,536 --> 00:15:53,770
Apat na libong yen?

335
00:15:53,793 --> 00:15:56,359
Medyo mahal nga.

336
00:15:56,382 --> 00:15:58,721
Pasensya na po.

337
00:15:58,745 --> 00:16:01,745
Pwede bang magpadala gamit ang app?

338
00:16:01,768 --> 00:16:03,061
Oo.

339
00:16:03,084 --> 00:16:06,218
Maaari mo ring ipadala sa pamamagitan ng internet banking.

340
00:16:06,241 --> 00:16:08,780
Mas mura ba iyon?

341
00:16:08,803 --> 00:16:10,459
Oo.

342
00:16:10,483 --> 00:16:14,249
Sa internet, ang bayad sa serbisyo ay 3000 yen.

343
00:16:14,272 --> 00:16:17,406
Gusto ko na lang sa internet gawin.

344
00:16:17,429 --> 00:16:19,229
Narito po.

345
00:16:19,252 --> 00:16:22,549
Kaya, magrehistro ka ba sa app?

346
00:16:22,572 --> 00:16:23,938
Oo.

347
00:16:23,961 --> 00:16:25,452
Pakiusap.

348
00:16:25,476 --> 00:16:28,242
Mayroon ka bang smartphone?

349
00:16:28,265 --> 00:16:29,799
Oo.

350
00:16:29,822 --> 00:16:31,293
Ito nga.

351
00:16:31,316 --> 00:16:34,483
I-download mo ang app ng bangko natin.

352
00:16:34,507 --> 00:16:36,311
Naintindihan ko po.

353
00:16:36,334 --> 00:16:38,101
Gagawin ko ngayon.

354
00:16:38,124 --> 00:16:41,091
Itanong mo lang kung may hindi ka maintindihan.

355
00:16:41,115 --> 00:16:42,681
Oo.

356
00:16:42,704 --> 00:16:44,704
Salamat po.

357
00:16:44,727 --> 00:16:46,227
Tagpo 10: Paano Magpapalit ng Dayuhang Pera

358
00:16:46,227 --> 00:16:48,594
Kamusta po.

359
00:16:48,617 --> 00:16:50,316
Paumanhin po.

360
00:16:50,340 --> 00:16:53,473
Gusto kong magpapalit ng dayuhang pera.

361
00:16:53,496 --> 00:16:55,576
Narito po.

362
00:16:55,600 --> 00:17:00,200
Gusto kong ipalit ang dolyar ng Amerika sa yen ng Japan.

363
00:17:00,223 --> 00:17:01,425
Oo.

364
00:17:01,448 --> 00:17:04,917
Ito ang palitan ng pera ngayong araw.

365
00:17:04,941 --> 00:17:08,021
Magkano ang isang dolyar?

366
00:17:08,045 --> 00:17:12,289
Ngayon, ang isang dolyar ay 150 yen.

367
00:17:12,313 --> 00:17:14,353
Naintindihan ko po.

368
00:17:14,376 --> 00:17:17,109
Palitan mo ako ng 500 dolyar.

369
00:17:17,132 --> 00:17:19,499
Narito po.

370
00:17:19,522 --> 00:17:23,122
Magkano lahat?

371
00:17:23,145 --> 00:17:27,393
Magiging 75,000 yen.

372
00:17:27,416 --> 00:17:30,750
May bayad ba sa serbisyo?

373
00:17:30,773 --> 00:17:34,839
Kasama na sa palitan ang bayad sa serbisyo.

374
00:17:34,862 --> 00:17:36,996
Naintindihan ko po.

375
00:17:37,019 --> 00:17:41,952
Pakisulat ang pangalan mo sa papel na ito.

376
00:17:41,975 --> 00:17:44,908
Pwede ba sa romanong letra?

377
00:17:44,931 --> 00:17:47,565
Oo, sige lang.

378
00:17:47,588 --> 00:17:49,621
Nakasulat na.

379
00:17:49,644 --> 00:17:52,677
Kailangan din ba ang pasaporte?

380
00:17:52,700 --> 00:17:54,467
Oo.

381
00:17:54,490 --> 00:17:58,290
Kailangan ito para sa pagkumpirma ng iyong pagkakakilanlan.

382
00:17:58,313 --> 00:18:01,513
Oo. Heto na.

383
00:18:01,536 --> 00:18:03,136
Salamat po.

384
00:18:03,159 --> 00:18:06,159
Kukumpirmahin ko po.

385
00:18:06,182 --> 00:18:09,415
Paano ko tatanggapin ang pera?

386
00:18:09,438 --> 00:18:16,605
Pwede ba ang pitong 10,000 yen at isang 5,000 yen?

387
00:18:16,628 --> 00:18:20,961
Pakihalo rin ng konting 1,000 yen.

388
00:18:20,984 --> 00:18:23,317
Narito po.

389
00:18:23,340 --> 00:18:32,999
Gawin mo na anim na 10,000 yen, isang 5,000 yen, at sampung 1,000 yen.

390
00:18:33,023 --> 00:18:36,196
Naiintindihan ko.

391
00:18:36,219 --> 00:18:38,291
Salamat po.

392
00:18:38,314 --> 00:18:40,748
Pasensya na po sa paghihintay.

393
00:18:40,771 --> 00:18:43,704
Ito na ang pera mo.

394
00:18:43,727 --> 00:18:45,773
Titingnan ko.

395
00:18:45,796 --> 00:18:48,663
Oo. Okay lang.

396
00:18:48,686 --> 00:18:50,743
Salamat po.

397
00:19:00,403 --> 00:19:01,903
Eksena 1: Proseso ng Pagbubukas ng Bank Account

398
00:19:01,903 --> 00:19:04,173
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

399
00:19:04,173 --> 00:19:06,740
Kamusta po.

400
00:19:06,740 --> 00:19:10,373
いらっしゃいませ = Maligayang pagdating

401
00:19:10,396 --> 00:19:13,744
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

402
00:19:13,744 --> 00:19:17,662
Ano po ang maipaglilingkod namin ngayon?

403
00:19:17,662 --> 00:19:23,039
どうされましたか = Ano ang maipaglilingkod ko?

404
00:19:23,062 --> 00:19:25,129
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

405
00:19:25,129 --> 00:19:27,429
Paumanhin po.

406
00:19:30,685 --> 00:19:34,427
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

407
00:19:34,427 --> 00:19:38,824
Gusto ko pong magbukas ng bank account.

408
00:19:38,824 --> 00:19:44,858
Vたい = Gusto kong gawin
銀行(ぎんこう) = Bangko
口座(こうざ) = Account sa bangko

409
00:19:44,881 --> 00:19:47,199
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

410
00:19:47,199 --> 00:19:49,833
Narito po.

411
00:19:49,833 --> 00:19:53,508
かしこまりました = Tiyak na maintindihan

412
00:19:53,531 --> 00:19:56,398
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

413
00:19:56,398 --> 00:19:59,698
Bagong account po ba ito?

414
00:19:59,698 --> 00:20:04,255
新(あたら)しい (bago) ↔ 古(ふる)い (luma)

415
00:20:04,278 --> 00:20:07,311
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

416
00:20:07,311 --> 00:20:10,811
Oo, tama po.

417
00:20:15,668 --> 00:20:19,401
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

418
00:20:19,401 --> 00:20:23,834
Nakatira po ba kayo sa Japan?

419
00:20:23,834 --> 00:20:29,868
お + N = Panlaping magalang
お客様(きゃくさま) = Kustomer
お住(す)まい = Tirahan

420
00:20:29,891 --> 00:20:32,163
Oo.

421
00:20:32,186 --> 00:20:35,553
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

422
00:20:35,553 --> 00:20:39,486
Nakatira na ako sa Tokyo mula noong nakaraang buwan.

423
00:20:39,486 --> 00:20:44,919
N + から = mula sa N
先月(せんげつ) (nakaraang buwan) ↔ 今月(こんげつ) (ngayong buwan)

424
00:20:44,942 --> 00:20:48,120
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

425
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:51,825
May trabaho po ba kayo?

426
00:20:51,825 --> 00:20:56,925
Vていますか = Ginagawa mo ba...?
お仕事(しごと) = Trabaho

427
00:20:56,948 --> 00:20:59,015
Oo.

428
00:20:59,038 --> 00:21:01,138
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

429
00:21:01,138 --> 00:21:03,472
Oo, empleyado ako.

430
00:21:03,472 --> 00:21:06,738
N + です = Ako ay N / Ito ay N
会社員(かいしゃいん) = Empleyado ng opisina

431
00:21:06,761 --> 00:21:09,195
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

432
00:21:09,195 --> 00:21:11,973
Naintindihan ko po.

433
00:21:15,862 --> 00:21:20,730
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

434
00:21:20,730 --> 00:21:26,564
Kailangan po ng ID para mabuksan ang account.

435
00:21:26,564 --> 00:21:34,472
N + が必要(ひつよう)です = Kailangan ang N
開設(かいせつ) = Pagbubukas (ng account)
身分証明書(みぶんしょうめいしょ) = Dokumento ng pagkakakilanlan

436
00:21:34,496 --> 00:21:37,996
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

437
00:21:37,996 --> 00:21:42,096
ID po ba?

438
00:21:42,096 --> 00:21:47,729
N + ですか = Ito ba ay N?

439
00:21:47,752 --> 00:21:49,552
Oo.

440
00:21:49,575 --> 00:21:53,475
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

441
00:21:53,475 --> 00:21:58,108
Mayroon po ba kayong Residence Card o pasaporte?

442
00:21:58,108 --> 00:22:04,408
N1 + や + N2 = N1 at N2
在留(ざいりゅう)カード = Residence card

443
00:22:04,431 --> 00:22:06,189
Oo.

444
00:22:06,213 --> 00:22:09,361
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

445
00:22:09,361 --> 00:22:13,061
Meron po akong Residence Card.

446
00:22:13,061 --> 00:22:18,129
Vています = Mayroon / Hawak
持(も)つ = Magkaroon / Hawakan

447
00:22:18,152 --> 00:22:20,252
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

448
00:22:20,252 --> 00:22:22,619
Salamat po.

449
00:22:25,942 --> 00:22:29,453
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

450
00:22:29,453 --> 00:22:33,568
Pakitignan po ito.

451
00:22:33,568 --> 00:22:39,235
Vてください = Mangyaring gawin...
見(み)せる = ipakita

452
00:22:39,258 --> 00:22:41,124
Oo.

453
00:22:41,147 --> 00:22:43,181
Heto po.

454
00:22:43,204 --> 00:22:45,516
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

455
00:22:45,516 --> 00:22:48,149
Kukumpirmahin ko po.

456
00:22:48,149 --> 00:22:51,816
Vいたします = magalang na anyo ng 'gawin'
確認(かくにん) = pagkumpirma / pag-check

457
00:22:51,839 --> 00:22:55,205
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

458
00:22:55,205 --> 00:22:59,141
Mayroon po ba kayong My Number Card?

459
00:22:59,141 --> 00:23:04,540
N + はありますか = Mayroon ba kayong N?
マイナンバーカード = My Number Card (Individual Number Card)

460
00:23:04,564 --> 00:23:08,076
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

461
00:23:08,076 --> 00:23:12,195
Wala pa po akong My Number Card.

462
00:23:12,195 --> 00:23:17,861
まだ + Vません = hindi pa nagagawa
まだ = hindi pa

463
00:23:17,884 --> 00:23:20,151
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

464
00:23:20,151 --> 00:23:22,706
Ganoon po ba.

465
00:23:26,320 --> 00:23:30,022
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

466
00:23:30,022 --> 00:23:34,379
May dokumento po ba kayong nagpapakita ng inyong My Number?

467
00:23:34,379 --> 00:23:40,412
V + N = [pandiwa] N
書類(しょるい) = dokumento

468
00:23:40,435 --> 00:23:43,469
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

469
00:23:43,469 --> 00:23:46,969
Meron po akong Resident Record.

470
00:23:46,969 --> 00:23:51,765
N + なら = kung ito ay N
住民票(じゅうみんひょう) = sertipiko ng tirahan

471
00:23:51,788 --> 00:23:53,888
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

472
00:23:53,888 --> 00:23:56,230
Salamat po.

473
00:23:59,553 --> 00:24:02,653
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

474
00:24:02,653 --> 00:24:06,245
Pakihatid po rin ang Resident Record.

475
00:24:06,245 --> 00:24:11,224
N + もお願(ねが)いします = Mangyaring, N din
お願(ねが)いします = mangyaring

476
00:24:11,248 --> 00:24:14,224
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

477
00:24:14,224 --> 00:24:17,696
Heto po.

478
00:24:22,506 --> 00:24:24,642
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

479
00:24:24,642 --> 00:24:27,075
Nakumpirma na po.

480
00:24:30,473 --> 00:24:34,240
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

481
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:38,673
Mayroon po ba kayong hanko?

482
00:24:38,673 --> 00:24:44,743
ご + N = magalang na panlapi
次(つぎ) = susunod
印鑑(いんかん) = personal na selyo

483
00:24:44,767 --> 00:24:47,667
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

484
00:24:47,667 --> 00:24:51,003
Wala po akong hanko.

485
00:24:51,003 --> 00:24:55,636
N + はありません = walang N

486
00:24:55,659 --> 00:24:58,597
Pagsusulit sa Pakikinig

487
00:24:58,597 --> 00:25:02,030
Pwede rin po ang pirma.

488
00:25:02,030 --> 00:25:06,735
